                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2a9e04fc-f060-3c6a-a3b3-8b6912fe33ab",
                        "entry_id": "8c2f7553-8ee0-3391-a13a-afb524b3aa9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ensemble des moteurs d’une usine, d’un bateau, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8692bac7-eaae-3b05-bd99-5ee63dfde3a0",
                        "entry_id": "8c2f7553-8ee0-3391-a13a-afb524b3aa9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ensemble des moteurs d’une usine, d’un bateau, etc.",
                            "Ensemble des machines concourant à un spectacle de théâtre, opéra, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "843c863e-e683-49db-97db-901f3f6021d2",
                                "sense_id": "8692bac7-eaae-3b05-bd99-5ee63dfde3a0",
                                "text": "[Tous ces auteurs et compositeurs] s’emprisonnent dans cette boîte de convention, parfaitement aménagée et sertie de tous les prestiges milliflores de la toile peinte avec la plus extrême minutie, obéissant aux lois sacro-saintes de la \"prospettiva\", servie par l’art complexe et industrieux de la machinerie."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2cb558c5-fe92-3e7d-8aa1-ab7d80bcb291",
                        "entry_id": "8c2f7553-8ee0-3391-a13a-afb524b3aa9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lieu où se trouvent toutes les machines motrices."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "50e96255-ff95-4eca-9e21-dbc8d2ea5f00",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c2f7553-8ee0-3391-a13a-afb524b3aa9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a9e04fc-f060-3c6a-a3b3-8b6912fe33ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "Ensemble de machines",
                        "target_lang_word": "machinery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "machinery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcf7b8b4-e7d9-3d57-a3db-e1317b08ab88",
                                        "entry_id": "b629b9c1-fe1a-3094-a211-f11280a93450",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The machines constituting a production apparatus, in a plant etc., collectively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "466a0d27-5480-4285-8dc4-0d7de4f8d45d",
                                                "sense_id": "bcf7b8b4-e7d9-3d57-a3db-e1317b08ab88",
                                                "text": "The external aspect of the oficina was not unlike that of a north-country coal or iron mine—tall chimneys and machinery, corrugated iron buildings, offices and houses, the shanties of workmen, a high bank of refuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2b2af04-2cee-4a11-a650-d1afd5260cf0",
                                                "sense_id": "bcf7b8b4-e7d9-3d57-a3db-e1317b08ab88",
                                                "text": "One or two wondered then, as if suddenly recalling the outlander, how he would manage, or if he would perish, up there among his unholy modern machineries that puffed out frozen steam to store the deer meat and shot fowl for him, […] \"And there were big boxes lugged up there, done up in iron clasps. Cruel-cold earth in those.\" […] \"Like corpse boxes,\" someone else suggested, down in the half-light, snug fust of the village drinking shop."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4e5eacf-d04c-49dc-8cd3-a33fd9e51316",
                                                "sense_id": "bcf7b8b4-e7d9-3d57-a3db-e1317b08ab88",
                                                "text": "All Mr. Yeats's grotesque machinery of sowlths and tevishes and sheogues leaves us without a shudder; his fantasies are stage-properties of the most unillusive kind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a030950-e1af-3636-a353-5e065616db54",
                                        "entry_id": "b629b9c1-fe1a-3094-a211-f11280a93450",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The working parts of a machine as a group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ca8030a-057c-3757-be23-ce3378d31333",
                                        "entry_id": "b629b9c1-fe1a-3094-a211-f11280a93450",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The collective parts of something which allow it to function."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46a50e37-ed47-4f4b-8302-b12592381f89",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca8030a-057c-3757-be23-ce3378d31333",
                                                "text": "All of the machinery of the law was brought to bear on the investigation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e755e816-ffe8-432c-bb02-69f584c1f63d",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca8030a-057c-3757-be23-ce3378d31333",
                                                "text": "Since the three histone-fold domain amino acids are located at the surface of the α-helix 2 domain that is responsible for the formation of H3-H4 dimers and accessible in prenucleosomal complexes, it has been suggested that the specificity associated with these amino acid positions derives from interactions with different assembly or post-translational-modification machineries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5c446eb-8402-3f1d-a6f3-abee83485d74",
                                        "entry_id": "b629b9c1-fe1a-3094-a211-f11280a93450",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The literary devices used in a work, notably for dramatic effect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d03c679-0dd6-4dd7-8817-17c70936641d",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c2f7553-8ee0-3391-a13a-afb524b3aa9f",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a9e04fc-f060-3c6a-a3b3-8b6912fe33ab",
